{
  "about": "Machine numbering cases for tooling.machines.number_layout and builder/core.mjs numberLayout. Each case numbers `machines` ([id, kind, requested], null where a machine asks for no number, as SDK 1.5 machines do) against `layout` and the fixed numbers (tooling.machines.FIXED_NUMBERS, with each machine's kind); `numbers` is the layout after, less the fixed machines, or `error` a fragment of the refusal. A number a machine asks for is given first; any other comes from its preferred place, FNV-1a of its ID modulo the pool size, upward with wraparound (pools: engines 34..255, pages 82..255, the free effect numbers).",
